 lowest. (proved on builded app) I also edited on pc for  the new ver and old ver on mobile\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. install gd 4.5-beta3\n2. have an redmi note 6 pro w los 22 with approx 700 mb ram left (64gb 4gb ram one  btw)\n3. make a simple lightweight scene w rigidbody3d as player n 2 joysticks n 2k materials in 3d n low poly count in capsule\n4. optimize it really well\n5. now no light = 60fps\n6. add light\n7. see the perf drop 💀💀💀💀\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n(New version of project) (Lacks materials)\n\n[editor.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23982644/editor.tar.gz)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113680/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113680/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}